{"step_index":1186,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-27T04:01:13Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-27T11:01:13+07:00\nCompleted At: 2026-08-27T11:01:13+07:00\nFile Path: `file:///c:/Demo.plane/index.html`\nTotal Lines: 1355\nTotal Bytes: 76792\nShowing lines 1050 to 1130\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1050:       btn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n1051:         const fit = btn.dataset.fit;\n1052:         const typeRaw = btn.dataset.type;\n1053:         if (fit !== 'soft') {\n1054:           sfx.bad();\n1055:           showPrompt('Mẹ', 'Món này hơi bất tiện. Con thử món khác nhé!');\n1056:           return;\n1057:         }\n1058:         const type = typeRaw === 'shirt' ? 'shirt' : typeRaw === 'pants' ? 'pants' : typeRaw === 'shoes' ? 'shoes' : null;\n1059:         if (!type) return;\n1060: \n1061:         if (window.binRenderer) {\n1062:           if (type === 'shirt') window.binRenderer.setShirt('yellow');\n1063:           if (type === 'pants') window.binRenderer.setPants('blue');\n1064:           if (type === 'shoes') window.binRenderer.setShoes('velcro');\n1065:         }\n1066: \n1067:         state.outfit[type] = true;\n1068:         btn.classList.add('runtime-selected');\n1069:         sfx.good();\n1070:         showPrompt('Mẹ', 'Đúng rồi! Món này mềm và dễ vận động.');\n1071: \n1072:         if (state.outfit.shirt && state.outfit.pants && state.outfit.shoes) {\n1073:           completeActivity(1);\n1074:           showFeedback(1);\n1075:         }\n1076:       });\n1077:     });\n1078:   }\n1079: \n1080:   function bindActivity2() {\n1081:     document.querySelectorAll('#act-2 [data-luggage-item=\"true\"]').forEach(btn => {\n1082:       btn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n1083:         if (btn.dataset.category === 'PACK') {\n1084:           btn.classList.add('runtime-packed');\n1085:           state.packed.add(btn);\n1086:           sfx.good();\n1087:           showPrompt('Bố', 'Ừ! Món này mình xếp vào vali nhé.');\n1088:           if (state.packed.size >= 3) {\n1089:             completeActivity(2);\n1090:             showFeedback(2);\n1091:           }\n1092:         } else {\n1093:           sfx.pop();\n1094:           showPrompt('Bố', 'Món này mình hỏi Ba Mẹ trước nhé!');\n1095:         }\n1096:       });\n1097:     });\n1098:   }\n1099: \n1100:   function bindSimpleActivities() {\n1101:     // Act 3: Kiểm tra vé & Đóng dấu lên Boarding Pass\n1102:     const onTicketCheck = () => {\n1103:       const stamp = el('pass-stamp-overlay');\n1104:       if (stamp) stamp.style.display = 'block';\n1105:       sfx.stamp();\n1106:       showPrompt('Mẹ', 'Vé của Bin đã được kiểm tra rồi! Chúc Bin chuyến bay vui vẻ!');\n1107:       completeActivity(3);\n1108:       showFeedback(3);\n1109:     };\n1110: \n1111:     el('btn-show-ticket-3')?.addEventListener('click', onTicketCheck);\n1112:     el('boarding-pass-card')?.addEventListener('click', onTicketCheck);\n1113: \n1114:     // Act 4: Soi hành lý\n1115:     document.querySelectorAll('#act-4 .xray-item-tile').forEach((tile, i) => {\n1116:       tile.addEventListener('click', () => {\n1117:         state.xrayChecked.add(i);\n1118:         tile.classList.add('runtime-checked');\n1119:         sfx.good();\n1120:         if (state.xrayChecked.size >= 3) {\n1121:           completeActivity(4);\n1122:           showFeedback(4);\n1123:         }\n1124:       });\n1125:     });\n1126: \n1127:     // Act 5: Cổng an ninh\n1128:     el('btn-walk-gate-5')?.addEventListener('click', () => {\n1129:       sfx.good();\n1130:       showPrompt('Mẹ', 'Bíp boong! Bin qua cửa an toàn rồi!');\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
{"step_index":1187,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-27T04:01:14Z","thinking":"**Refining Activity Binding**\n\nI'm currently focused on refining how activities are bound to their respective UI elements. Specifically, I'm updating `bindActivity2()` and `bindSimpleActivities()` in `index.html` (lines 1080-1135). I'm concentrating on the 'PACK' category, ensuring that clicking these items accurately updates the `state.packed` and adds the corresponding badge to the `#suitcase-packed-items` section. The badge is a `packed-badge` class with a `pop-in-soft` animation.\n\n\n**Implementing Activity Effects**\n\nI've just added detailed effects to activity bindings. Now, when a 'PACK' item is clicked, I play `sfx.good()`, fade the button's opacity, and disable its pointer events. Then, a positive prompt for Bố appears, affirming the packing decision. If three items are packed, I call `completeActivity(2)` and `showFeedback(2)`. For 'LEAVE_HOME' items, clicking will play `sfx.bad()` and display specific, context-aware negative prompts based on the item's name (e.g., \"Kéo nhọn,\" \"Ô tô to,\" or \"Bình lớn\").\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Cập nhật logic tương tác Act 2 (đồ bay vào vali, bỉm, gấu bông, bỏ lại ô tô to, kéo nhọn) và Act 3 (khoanh đỏ số ghế 12A và đóng dấu)","EndLine":1135,"Instruction":"Cập nhật bindActivity2 và Act 3 trong index.html","ReplacementContent":"  function bindActivity2() {\n    document.querySelectorAll('#act-2 [data-luggage-item=\"true\"]').forEach(btn => {\n      btn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        const cat = btn.dataset.category;\n        const name = btn.dataset.name || 'Món đồ';\n        const icon = btn.dataset.icon || '📦';\n\n        if (cat === 'PACK') {\n          btn.classList.add('runtime-packed');\n          btn.style.opacity = '0.5';\n          btn.style.pointerEvents = 'none';\n          state.packed.add(name);\n\n          // Thêm hình ảnh/badge đồ vật trực tiếp vào trong vali mở\n          const targetSuitcase = el('suitcase-packed-items');\n          if (targetSuitcase) {\n            const badge = document.createElement('div');\n            badge.style.background = 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95)';\n            badge.style.border = '2px solid #0288D1';\n            badge.style.borderRadius = '12px';\n            badge.style.padding = '4px 8px';\n            badge.style.fontSize = '12px';\n            badge.style.fontWeight = '900';\n            badge.style.color = '#01579B';\n            badge.style.display = 'flex';\n            badge.style.alignItems = 'center';\n            badge.style.gap = '4px';\n            badge.style.boxShadow = '0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.18)';\n            badge.innerHTML = `${icon} ${name} ✓`;\n            targetSuitcase.appendChild(badge);\n          }\n\n          sfx.good();\n          showPrompt('Bố', `Đúng rồi! ${name} cần thiết mang theo!`);\n          if (state.packed.size >= 3) {\n            completeActivity(2);\n            showFeedback(2);\n          }\n        } else {\n          sfx.bad();\n          if (name === 'Kéo nhọn') {\n            showPrompt('Bố', 'Kéo nhọn nguy hiểm, không được mang lên máy bay con nhé!');\n          } else if (name === 'Ô tô to') {\n            showPrompt('Bố', 'Ô tô to quá chiếm hết vali, mình để ở nhà chơi sau nhé!');\n          } else {\n            showPrompt('Bố', 'Bình nước lớn qua cổng an ninh không được mang, mình để ở nhà nhé!');\n          }\n        }\n      });\n    });\n  }\n\n  function bindSimpleActivities() {\n    // Act 3: Kiểm tra vé & Khoanh tròn Đỏ Số Ghế 12A & Đóng dấu Boarding Pass\n    const onTicketCheck = () => {\n      const redCircle = el('seat-red-circle');\n      if (redCircle) redCircle.style.display = 'block';\n      const stamp = el('pass-stamp-overlay');\n      if (stamp) stamp.style.display = 'block';\n\n      sfx.good();\n      setTimeout(() => sfx.stamp(), 200);\n\n      showPrompt('Mẹ', 'Giỏi lắm! Ghế 12A là ghế cạnh cửa sổ của Bin đấy!');\n      completeActivity(3);\n      showFeedback(3);\n    };\n\n    el('seat-selection-btn')?.addEventListener('click', onTicketCheck);\n    el('btn-show-ticket-3')?.addEventListener('click', onTicketCheck);\n    el('boarding-pass-card')?.addEventListener('click', onTicketCheck);","StartLine":1080,"TargetContent":"  function bindActivity2() {\n    document.querySelectorAll('#act-2 [data-luggage-item=\"true\"]').forEach(btn => {\n      btn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        if (btn.dataset.category === 'PACK') {\n          btn.classList.add('runtime-packed');\n          state.packed.add(btn);\n          sfx.good();\n          showPrompt('Bố', 'Ừ! Món này mình xếp vào vali nhé.');\n          if (state.packed.size >= 3) {\n            completeActivity(2);\n            showFeedback(2);\n          }\n        } else {\n          sfx.pop();\n          showPrompt('Bố', 'Món này mình hỏi Ba Mẹ trước nhé!');\n        }\n      });\n    });\n  }\n\n  function bindSimpleActivities() {\n    // Act 3: Kiểm tra vé & Đóng dấu lên Boarding Pass\n    const onTicketCheck = () => {\n      const stamp = el('pass-stamp-overlay');\n      if (stamp) stamp.style.display = 'block';\n      sfx.stamp();\n      showPrompt('Mẹ', 'Vé của Bin đã được kiểm tra rồi! Chúc Bin chuyến bay vui vẻ!');\n      completeActivity(3);\n      showFeedback(3);\n    };\n\n    el('btn-show-ticket-3')?.addEventListener('click', onTicketCheck);\n    el('boarding-pass-card')?.addEventListener('click', onTicketCheck);","TargetFile":"c:\\Demo.plane\\index.html","toolAction":"Editing file","toolSummary":"Update JavaScript handlers for Act 2 and Act 3 in index.html"}}]}
